    "version": 2,
    "content": "Chubb's Marsh-placed premium increased from $300 (2024) to $390 (2025), a 30% increase across the 4 comparable product lines returned.\n\n- Property was the largest growth contributor, adding $60 (60% growth) and accounting for 54.55% of the gross increases.\n- Marine had the largest decline, down $20 (33.33%); declines totalled $20, offsetting 18.18% of the gross increases.\n- 3 of the 4 comparable product lines grew, 1 declined and 0 were unchanged.\n- Property was the largest returned product line at $160, representing 41.03% of current premium versus 33.33% previously.\n- Cyber premium increased from $80 to $100, a 25% increase.\n- Casualty premium increased from $60 to $90, a 50% increase.",
